WEBVTT

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.520
Hello.

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:08.000
You seem like you might be lost.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.440
Oh my.

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:16.480
Oh my. Oh my.

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:20.960
Humans aren't meant to be here.

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:24.080
It's not safe

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:27.439
for you.

00:00:27.439 --> 00:00:30.960
It seems that your soul and heart have

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:35.760
been overtaken by some sort of

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:40.879
effect of the forest.

00:00:40.879 --> 00:00:46.559
Don't worry, I'm here. I can heal you.

00:00:46.559 --> 00:00:50.000
I just need to

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:04.080
assess

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:06.159
I see.

00:01:06.159 --> 00:01:09.760
I need to purify the area. Please stand

00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:47.360
back.

00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:48.960
Okay,

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:52.159
we are safe for now.

00:01:52.159 --> 00:01:56.000
Don't you worry. You look afraid.

00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:00.479
It's okay, little one.

00:02:00.479 --> 00:02:03.600
I apologize. I'm not used to dealing

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:06.320
with humans.

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:10.319
Uh, my name is Novabella.

00:02:10.319 --> 00:02:14.640
It's nice to meet you.

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:18.319
I see that you're injured.

00:02:18.319 --> 00:02:21.520
It's a heart injury.

00:02:21.520 --> 00:02:24.959
So, in order to fix a heart injury, you

00:02:24.959 --> 00:02:27.840
need a fruit from this forest. I have a

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:35.680
fruit from one of the trees nearby.

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:37.599
These aren't the type of fruit that you

00:02:37.599 --> 00:02:41.760
would encounter in your world.

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:47.360
Generally, not edible to humans.

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:50.400
However,

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:54.160
I can break one open

00:02:54.160 --> 00:02:56.080
and spread

00:02:56.080 --> 00:02:58.400
its healing properties

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:01.840
over you.

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:05.760
That way, you won't injure your little

00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:24.640
human teeth on these things.

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:30.560
there.

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:36.080
Just spreading the juices

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:41.360
just across your skin.

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:52.799
Do you feel its healing properties?

00:03:52.799 --> 00:03:59.840
You're looking better already.

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:18.320
Quite delicious.

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:21.120
There. Much better.

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:24.560
Okay, you're stabilized for now. Next,

00:04:24.560 --> 00:04:29.360
I'm going to use these artifacts

00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:36.720
to cast protection spell on you.

00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:40.160
Good job,

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:58.080
good

00:04:58.080 --> 00:05:11.840
woman.

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:14.720
Good.

00:05:14.720 --> 00:05:18.880
This will keep you safe

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:23.680
on the rest of your travels

00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:27.600
and soon you won't have to worry about

00:05:27.600 --> 00:05:33.120
little mishaps like this.

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:36.880
And this will last for a few days

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:39.120
and the forest won't recognize you as

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:42.639
human.

00:05:42.639 --> 00:05:46.960
So you can feel free to explore, but

00:05:46.960 --> 00:05:49.520
don't tell anyone I did this for you

00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:54.000
because I'm not really supposed to do

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:57.680
favors for humans.

00:05:57.680 --> 00:06:02.160
The others don't really appreciate

00:06:02.160 --> 00:06:06.880
humans being on the territory, but

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:10.960
I can tell you meant no harm.

00:06:10.960 --> 00:06:26.240
You're just adventurous, aren't you?

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:30.960
Good.

00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:35.919
Okay.

00:06:35.919 --> 00:06:38.240
Oh, you're looking better already. I can

00:06:38.240 --> 00:06:41.440
tell you're excited, aren't you?

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:43.360
Is this your first time getting

00:06:43.360 --> 00:06:49.120
permission to wander such an area? Well,

00:06:49.120 --> 00:06:52.160
still be careful because the others

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:55.360
might not be so friendly.

00:06:55.360 --> 00:06:58.319
You could stay by my side and maybe I

00:06:58.319 --> 00:07:03.039
could guide you.

00:07:03.039 --> 00:07:05.360
If you walk behind me, they won't see

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:07.280
you.

00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:13.680
I can hide you whenever others appear.

00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:16.400
I've been wanting to go on adventures. I

00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:18.479
find humans are the most adventurous

00:07:18.479 --> 00:07:20.000
creatures.

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:24.479
It's very fascinating.

00:07:24.479 --> 00:07:26.960
Would you like to

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:30.479
be an adventure with me?

00:07:30.479 --> 00:07:32.960
Okay. I have another spell that I need

00:07:32.960 --> 00:07:38.720
to put on you, though.

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:42.720
This bundle contains

00:07:42.720 --> 00:07:48.960
a special spell.

00:07:48.960 --> 00:07:53.360
It'll make you faster,

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:56.000
stronger,

00:07:56.000 --> 00:08:02.400
and you will have the ability to fly.

00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:07.759
Yes. So, you can fly with me.

00:08:07.759 --> 00:08:12.639
Once I open this bottle, you'll find a a

00:08:12.639 --> 00:08:15.680
feeling quite overwhelming, but I

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:19.199
promise you'll be okay.

00:08:19.199 --> 00:08:21.840
It might make you fall asleep for a

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:24.800
short period because humans are quite

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:27.520
used to the intensity.

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:32.159
So, if you find yourself getting sleepy,

00:08:32.159 --> 00:08:37.200
just let it happen. Invite it forward.

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:39.760
Let this leave take you. I'll be here

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:43.919
next to you watching over you. Okay?

00:08:43.919 --> 00:08:47.360
And then when you wake up, we can go on

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:50.240
our little adventure.

00:08:50.240 --> 00:08:52.320
But for now, just get comfortable. I'm

00:08:52.320 --> 00:08:53.839
going to open this bell bottle now.

00:08:53.839 --> 00:09:11.920
Okay?

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:13.519
You should feel it starting to take

00:09:13.519 --> 00:09:16.959
effect. And while you do that,

00:09:16.959 --> 00:09:20.959
just going to guide it along gently like

00:09:20.959 --> 00:09:48.560
this.

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:50.959
You'll find that it's taking all of your

00:09:50.959 --> 00:09:53.680
negative energy

00:09:53.680 --> 00:09:56.240
and releasing it.

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:59.120
Because in order to have the abilities

00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:02.160
like me, you need to be free of those

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:04.560
things.

00:10:04.560 --> 00:10:07.120
So, it's a little bit of a purge.

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:10.480
Makes you quite sleepy.

00:10:10.480 --> 00:10:12.720
I believe humans hold a lot of this

00:10:12.720 --> 00:10:15.600
negative energy. So, it'll feel like

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:17.760
what a relief

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:51.600
as it starts leaving your body.

00:10:51.600 --> 00:11:08.160
around.

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:10.720
Good.

00:11:10.720 --> 00:11:17.680
Good girl.

00:11:17.680 --> 00:11:38.000
Fore

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:53.200
tickle.

00:11:53.200 --> 00:12:36.399
Foreign

00:12:36.399 --> 00:12:59.120
There you go.

00:12:59.120 --> 00:13:15.120
perfect.

00:13:15.120 --> 00:13:27.440
Good.

00:13:27.440 --> 00:13:32.320
Looks like you are drifting off.

00:13:32.320 --> 00:13:37.760
That's okay. You are perfectly safe.

00:13:37.760 --> 00:13:41.519
Don't worry. You're safe. You can relax.

00:13:41.519 --> 00:13:43.680
There you go.

00:13:43.680 --> 00:13:46.800
Good.

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:49.839
Just relax. You can close your eyes if

00:13:49.839 --> 00:13:52.720
you'd like or you can leave them open

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:56.720
until you can't hold them anymore.

00:13:56.720 --> 00:14:00.560
Whatever is most comfortable to you.

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:03.279
Just keep breathing

00:14:03.279 --> 00:14:08.480
deeply at your own pace. Okay.

00:14:08.480 --> 00:14:13.440
Marvelous.

00:14:13.440 --> 00:14:15.440
I can feel your negative energy

00:14:15.440 --> 00:14:17.680
releasing.

00:14:17.680 --> 00:14:54.399
It feels like such a wonderful relief.

00:14:54.399 --> 00:15:00.320
Good.

00:15:00.320 --> 00:15:05.199
And there you go. Sleep tight.

00:15:05.199 --> 00:15:11.600
I will guard you while you sleep.

00:15:11.600 --> 00:15:18.480
There you go. Just drift, drift, drift.

00:15:18.480 --> 00:15:21.120
I will see you

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:23.360
in a while

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:26.880
and we will start our adventures

00:15:26.880 --> 00:15:30.079
together.

00:15:30.079 --> 00:15:35.079
Good night.
